---
const swimplyUrl = 'https://swimply.com/pooldetails/81440?lfl=qDDrfv5K';
---
<section class="cta-band cta-band-craft" id="cta" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
  <div class="section-label" style="display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:14px;">
    Next Step
  </div>
  <h2 id="cta-title">Tell Us What You Are Planning.</h2>
  <p class="sub">
    The space and the services book through two different paths. The Oasis goes through
    Swimply for insurance and liability. DJ, photo booth, vendor planning, and day-of
    experience help start with the Fam Jam intake.
  </p>

  <div class="cta-choice-grid">
    <div class="cta-choice cta-choice-space">
      <span class="cta-kicker">The Space</span>
      <h3>Book The Oasis through Swimply.</h3>
      <p>
        For insurance and liability purposes, all space reservations are scheduled through
        Swimply. Pick your date and time there first.
      </p>
      <a href={swimplyUrl} class="btn btn-cyan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Schedule On Swimply
        <span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-choice cta-choice-services">
      <span class="cta-kicker">DJ + Booth + Planning</span>
      <h3>Send the party details.</h3>
      <p>
        Use the intake for DJ, photo booth, vendor planning, and experience help. Tell us the
        date, crowd, hours, and what you want the party to feel like.
      </p>
      <a href="/book" class="btn btn-pink">Fill Out Intake Form</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="serving">Serving Thousand Oaks &middot; Simi Valley &middot; Calabasas &middot; Westlake Village &middot; Moorpark &middot; Agoura Hills &middot; Woodland Hills &amp; beyond</p>
</section>
